		<p>To open the glove box:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>Pull the handle and the glove box will open automatically.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>Close the glove box after use.</p>
		<note type="warning">
			<p importance="high">Glove Box</p>
			<p>To reduce the risk of injury in an accident or sudden stop, always keep the glove box door closed while driving.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="caution">
			<p>Do not keep food in the glove box for a long time.</p>
		</note>
